<section class="container mx-auto px-4 py-6">
  <div class="mb-16 bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-primefix-navy">How to Find Your Appliance Model and Serial  
            Number</h3>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
      Before scheduling your appliance repair service, it's helpful to have your model and serial number  
            ready. This information helps our technicians prepare for your service call with the right parts and
            tools.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Sub-Zero Appliances:</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li>• Open the refrigerator door</li>
          <li>• Look for a silver label on the upper left or right interior wall</li>
          <li>• The model number starts with "BI" for built-in units or "PRO" for professional series
          </li>
          <li>• Serial number is typically 6-8 digits</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Wolf Appliances:</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li>• Check inside the oven door or on the oven frame</li>
          <li>• Look on the back or side of ranges</li>
          <li>• For cooktops, check underneath or on the side</li>
          <li>• Model numbers typically start with "SO" for ovens or "GR" for ranges</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Cove Appliances:</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li>• Open the dishwasher door</li>
          <li>• Look for the label on the left or right side of the tub</li>
          <li>• May also be located on the door frame</li>
          <li>• Model numbers typically start with "DW"</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg">
      <p class="text-primefix-navy font-semibold">💡 Pro Tip: Take a photo of the label with your phone  
                before calling. This ensures accuracy and speeds up our diagnostic process.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

